# Lane notes: C10, N13, N10 (ide-a)

## Shared-file requests for the integrator

- Cargo.lock: `mpp-ide` now also depends on `egui_tiles` 0.18 (serde feature), `serde` 1, `serde_json` 1, `notify` 8 and `trash` 5. Regenerate the lockfile after merging.
- eframe is used without its `persistence` feature, so settings and the session live in our own JSON file in the app-data folder (`settings/`), never inside a project.
- Guide text (docs/guide.mpp): the explorer, tabs and navigation keys are listed in the module doc of `workspace/ui.rs` and in the C10 row.

## Keys added (C10)

- `Ctrl+B` side bar, `Ctrl+P` quick open, `Ctrl+Shift+F` search all files, `Ctrl+Shift+E` explorer, `F2` rename, `Alt+Left` and `Alt+Right` back and forward, `Ctrl+Tab` and `Ctrl+Shift+Tab` cycle tabs, `Ctrl+W` close tab, `Shift+F12` find all uses, `Ctrl+0` reset zoom.

## Merge notes

- `app.rs`: the old `side_panel`, `close_tab`, `folder`/`files` fields are gone. The window is now `menu`, `status_ui`, `side_ui`, `header_ui`, central page. `IdeApp::ws` holds the project, side bar, search and history state.
- `view.rs`: one new `ViewEvent::OpenLinkAt` and one call that emits it on a click.
- `doc.rs`: `Doc::id`, `Doc::reload`, `Doc::problems`.

## N13 tile manager

- Panels are `egui_tiles` tiles (`layout/tiles.rs` pure operations, `layout/behavior.rs` the app glue). The old side panel and tab strip are gone: the Explorer, Search, Outline, Variables, Problems (placeholder until N9), Steps and Standard library (placeholders) and every equation view are tiles.
- Keys: `Ctrl+\` split right, `Ctrl+Shift+\` split down, `Ctrl+Shift+Enter` or double-click a tab to maximise and restore, `Ctrl+K` then an arrow moves focus.
- Layouts are saved per project in the app-data folder (`layouts/<hash>.json`); View → Layout lists the built-in Writing, Graphing and Review and any saved names; View → Reset layout.
- Right-click a figure → "Open in tile" (`ViewEvent::OpenFigureTile` in view.rs).
- The variables tile edits the plain number after a `:=` (slider and input box) and the evaluation follows.

## N10 IDE tools

- Undo and redo stay with the editor (it already groups a run of typing into one step and restores the caret); `history/` adds the browsable trail (Edit → History lists steps as the typeset block that changed; any step restores as one undoable edit). The editor groups all contiguous typing, not word by word: change that in `editor/` if per-word steps are wanted.
- Autosave: Edit → Autosave (off, after a second of quiet, when the window loses focus). Recovery copies go to `<app data>/recovery/` every three seconds for files with unsaved edits and are removed on save or close; the next start-up offers "Restore unsaved changes to N files?" with a typeset side-by-side compare (`autosave/compare.rs`).
- Zoom: `Ctrl+=`, `Ctrl+-`, `Ctrl+0`, `Ctrl+scroll` scale the page (and so every graph on it); remembered in the settings file. egui's own keyboard zoom is switched off in `EframeApp::new`.
- Tutorial: eleven lessons plus `constants.mpp` in `tutorial/lessons.rs`, written to `<app data>/tutorial/` on first launch and from Help → Tutorial. The units and steps lessons describe the tools in words until those lanes are integrated; update them then.
- Did you mean: `suggest::Suggester` has `names`, `symbols`, `units`, `phrases` and `files` with the same shapes as ide-b's `diagnostics::suggest::Suggest` plug point. After the merge, implement that trait for `Suggester` and call `set_suggester(Arc::new(Suggester))` in `EframeApp::new`; autocomplete in `editor/symbols.rs` can call `Suggester::names` and `phrases` too. In this lane it is used by the search view ("Did you mean …?") and by the missing-import message.
- Shared scratch note: two lanes wrote scripts to the same scratchpad folder; keep lane scripts in a per-lane subfolder.
